---
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/content';

const defaultPath = sitePath('topics/runtime-and-orchestration/');
const crossCuttingPath = sitePath('topics/deployment-and-scheduling/');
const servingPath = sitePath('topics/inference-and-model-serving/');
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={new URL(defaultPath, Astro.site)} />
    <title>进入主题内容 · Agentic Infra</title>
    <script id="topic-redirect" is:inline define:vars={{ defaultPath, crossCuttingPath, servingPath }}>
      const destinations = {
        '#agent-core': defaultPath,
        '#cross-cutting': crossCuttingPath,
        '#related-infrastructure': servingPath,
      };
      const destination = destinations[location.hash] || defaultPath;
      const hash = Object.hasOwn(destinations, location.hash) ? '' : location.hash;
      location.replace(destination + location.search + hash);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="main-content">
      <h1>主题导航已直接进入内容页</h1>
      <p>从运行时与编排开始阅读，通过页面侧栏切换其他主题。</p>
      <ul>
        <li id="agent-core"><a href={defaultPath}>运行时与编排</a></li>
        <li id="cross-cutting"><a href={crossCuttingPath}>部署与调度</a></li>
        <li id="related-infrastructure"><a href={servingPath}>推理与模型服务</a></li>
      </ul>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body { margin: 0; background: #f7f8f2; color: #222d27; font: 16px/1.8 system-ui, sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 640px; margin: 12vh auto; padding: 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: #215b49; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
